  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe locally-produced vegetables for West Africa&#xbf;s consumers (SAFEVEG - West Africa)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will promote the role of vegetables in agricultural research and local food systems in the Sahel region of West Africa, thereby contributing to climate resilience across the vegetable value chain, better incomes and sustainable land use for smallholder farmers and better nutrition for farm families and other consumers.</narrative>
  </description>
